  \"languageTermsOverrides\": [
    { \"localeIdentifier\": \"en-US\", \"wakeWords\": [\"Aether\", \"Hey Aether\"], \"commandPrefixes\": [\"command\"], \"dictationPrefixes\": [\"type\"] }
  ]
}

Notes:
- commandOverrides.aliases are additive (only provide new aliases).
- commandID allowed values: {{COMMAND_IDS}}
- localeIdentifier should be standard (e.g., en-US, zh-CN).
- Custom app rules are copied and pasted separately from the voice lexicon. If the history suggests app-specific send/submit shortcuts, use the current custom app rules as reference when suggesting aliases.

Current config (AetherVoiceLexicon JSON):
{{CURRENT_LEXICON_JSON}}

Current custom app rules (JSON):
{{CUSTOM_APP_RULES_JSON}}

Usage summary (total={{SUMMARY_TOTAL}}, dictation={{SUMMARY_DICTATION}}, control={{SUMMARY_CONTROL}}, locale={{LOCALE}}):
{{USAGE_JSON}}
